<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta L</annotation></semantics></math><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> Normalization</span>: Rethink Loss Aggregation in RLVR</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zhiyuan He
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
