<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Entropy on CountDown and 3B model. Legend is the same as Figure <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Training Dynamics. ‣ 4.2 Main Results ‣ 4 Evaluation ‣ Δ⁢𝐿 Normalization: Rethink Loss Aggregation in RLVR" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
